
== 1. Probe table ==============================================
  RASSF9 :  12 probes  (5 core, 2 shore, 5 distal)
  RASSF10:  36 probes  (9 core, 2 shore, 25 distal)
  total  :  48

  NOTE: script 35 retrieved 51 probes at these two loci but the
  correlation table holds 48. Three RASSF10 probes are absent, presumably
  dropped as all-NA. All 11 RASSF10 promoter-window probes are present,
  so the promoter question is unaffected. State this in the methods.

  TCGA complete-cohort medians, promoter core (what cell lines must beat
  to be called hypermethylated):
    RASSF9   median beta across core probes: 0.385  (range 0.191 - 0.632)
    RASSF10  median beta across core probes: 0.086  (range 0.017 - 0.337)
    RASSF9's core is INTERMEDIATE in tumours, not high. RASSF10's is
    nearly unmethylated. Neither locus is a silenced-by-hypermethylation
    picture in bulk tumour to begin with.

